    "title": "DailyWire+",
    "description": "What began as a news and conservative podcast company in 2015 has rapidly grown into the number one voice of counter-culture in America.\r\n\r\nThe DailyWire+ App is the streaming home of The Daily Wire, Ben Shapiro, Jordan Peterson, Matt Walsh, DailyWire+ Movies, and PragerU. We fight for what we believe in. We have fun doing it, and we make it entertaining. Download DailyWire+ to access top news, commentary, investigative journalism, podcasts, movies, documentaries, original series, and more.\r\n\r\nThe Daily Wire contributors \u2014 Ben Shapiro, Dr. Jordan B. Peterson, Matt Walsh, Michael Knowles, Andrew Klavan, Jeremy Boreing and Brett Cooper. Dropping Truth Bombs daily. Featuring The Ben Shapiro Show; The Andrew Klavan Show; The Michael Knowles Show; The Matt Walsh Show; Daily Wire Backstage; The Comment Section with Brett Cooper, and more.\r\n\r\nJordan Peterson \u2014 The world of Dr Jordan B Peterson, the premiere public intellectual of our time and author of 12 Rules for Life. Featuring The Jordan B Peterson Podcast; and DailyWire+ exclusive series Exodus, Foundations of the West and the Mastering Life Collection from Dr. Jordan B. Peterson including Vision & Destiny, Dragons, Monsters, and Men, Marriage, Depression & Anxiety, Negotiations, Success and more.\r\n\r\nMovies \u2014 The only agenda is entertainment. Original and exclusive feature films, docs, and more. Featuring Am I Racist, What is a Woman, Lady Ballers, Run Hide Fight, Terror on the Prairie, Shut In, and more.\r\n\r\nNews - Get daily coverage of the latest developments in politics, culture, education, sports and more. Get the facts first on the news you need to know. The Daily Wire does not claim to be without bias. We\u2019re opinionated, we say and do what no one else will in pursuit of the truth.\r\n\r\nPragerU \u2014 World-famous 5-Minute Videos and more from Dennis Prager, and PragerU Kids. Featuring 5-Minute Videos; Fireside Chats with Dennis Prager, Man on the Street, PragerU Kids, and more.\r\n\r\nFor help with DailyWire+, please visit support.dailywire.com",
